# Essence spam: guarantee maximum Life on a pair of boots while fishing the
# random (non-guaranteed) mods for a top-tier elemental resistance.
#
# Deafening Essence of Greed guarantees "+ to maximum Life" and reforges every
# other mod on each application. Being a top tier (>= Screaming), it can reforge
# a RARE item — so after the first Normal -> Rare application the loop keeps
# re-rolling. A low-tier essence would fail here: it only upgrades Normal items,
# so the second iteration (now Rare) would have nothing to work on.
#
# `t1` selects the best tier (Deafening); we spin until the random fill happens to
# include a T1 fire, cold, or lightning resistance — any of the three is a win.
# (A future `def anyEleRes(t) = …` would let us write `until anyEleRes(1)`.)

craft in poe1

item {
    base:   "Titan Greaves"
    ilvl:   84            # high enough for T1 elemental resistances to roll
    rarity: normal
}

until has "fire resistance" t1
   or has "cold resistance" t1
   or has "lightning resistance" t1 {
    essence "greed" t1
}
